            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "9. An employee shall receive length-of-service benefits related to employment that would have been granted had the employee not been absent, except that the employee shall not receive credit toward completion of a probationary period (See Section L.10 of this Agreement) vacation and sick leave accruals and holiday pay shall be granted only in accordance with those articles of this Agreement.",
